# Design & voice

Journal + creative space, NOT WeekOS-style metrics. Full spec: @context/ui-context.md

**WeekOS = borrow structure** (theme, tabs, spacing, auth). **Reject its soul** (scores,
quotas, progress bars, pillar charts, "needs attention", checkbox review grids).

Tokens in `packages/tokens` only — `bg-base`, `accent-primary`, `stage-*`, etc.
Light and dark both exist; default is light.

**Typography:** Fraunces display + Source Sans 3 body. Not Inter for everything.

**Voice:** "What shifted today?" · quality words (unfocused → in the zone) · feeling chips
(nervous/neutral/excited). BANNED: streaks, % scores, X/wk targets, reward tiers,
trend graphs as judgment.

**UI surfaces:** Studio = daily hub (riyaz + Stand); Songs = notebooks + Drift;
Skills = guitar/vocal lab; Report = monthly look-back; Coach = mentor chat on Studio.

**Hallmark** ([usehallmark.com](https://www.usehallmark.com/)): `npx skills add nutlope/hallmark`.
Audit every major screen. Also use design-review skill.
